/S /H3
/P 381 0 R
/T (Most learners reported low-to-moderate interruptions, but not everyone has the same experience. A smaller group faces frequent breaks, which hurts focus and makes learning slower. So, the same app design works differently for different users because of device/internet conditions. Main inference: Access issues create unequal learning outcomes even when motivation is similar.)
