>>
endobj
943 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 389 0 R
/E (Initial content encoding is strong, leveraging clear verbal and visual explanations. However, the platform significantly lacks effective mechanisms for long-term retention, with minimal spaced repetition and passive review methods, contributing to low confidence in longer retention.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
944 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 389 0 R
/T <4E69656C73656E90732055736162696C6974792048657572697374696373>
