/Pg 46 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
945 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 389 0 R
/E (The platform performs well in "Recognition Rather than Recall" and "User Control." Key weaknesses include visual clutter \(Aesthetic Design\), inconsistent interface behavior, insufficient error prevention, and gamified terminology that often misaligns with user mental models.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
946 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 389 0 R
/T (Real-World Problems)
/E (Real-World Problems)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
947 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 389 0 R
/E (Gamification's instrumental value collapses, leading to disengagement and shallow learning. Significant concerns around access, cultural alignment, and the polarizing effect of social comparison were noted. Users also expressed doubts about progress tracking accuracy, reflected in a Net Promoter Score of -26.92.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
